comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-14T10:55:53.603Z",codex-toolchain-1114a,"Failure -> cause -> fix: raw Mermaid export of 36 long-identity fixture nodes now exits 2 -> GH-1678 (pm-cli CHANGELOG 2026.11.8) enforces the custom renderer byte budget, correctly measuring 7736 tokens against the unchanged 4000-token default -> exercise the existing root/depth shaping for a valid small raw document, and retain the entire large fixture as an explicit output_budget_exceeded refusal (requested_budget_infeasible, exit 2, default budget 4000, measured tokens above budget). Full structured export with an explicit unbounded control must still return every fixture row. Keep the before-write file/control refusal and add an authoritative tracker fingerprint check. No production code, thresholds or row-count requirements changed."
  "2026-11-14T10:57:50.249Z",codex-toolchain-1114a,"Final linked focused run passes 3/3 tests with zero failures, cancellations or skips: bounded raw document plus oversized default-budget refusal and complete structured export, compact file receipts, and diagram/control behavior. The oversized refusal is checked in TOON, retaining its 4000-token ceiling; JSON has a distinct 6000-token default, so the test does not compare those format-specific defaults. Authoritative tracker bytes remain unchanged. npm/Bun typecheck, build:test, lint, zero-duplication gate (0%, unchanged 0% threshold), and docstrings (220 declarations) pass. Original current-pin raw case fails exit 2 before adaptation, providing migration revert proof. Full npm/Bun release checks remain queued serially at unchanged coverage thresholds."
  "2026-11-14T12:37:27.482Z",codex-toolchain-1114a,"Complete local release evidence for source commit 38628587d0099730faf64ab0b3ace5b36baeaaab: npm run release:check and bun run release:check both exit 0, each with 454 passing tests and zero failures/cancellations/skips. The gate certifies all 33 runtime source files: 99.81% lines, 95.73% branches, 100% functions, meeting the unchanged 99.7/94.9/100 thresholds. Typecheck, lint, 0% duplication, docstrings, audit, pack inspection, changelog and release attestation/date gates pass. The existing exact-head CI is queued at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-graph/actions/runs/43587775169; this tracker-only evidence commit will wait for the shared-runner hold before pushing. No production code or threshold was changed."
  "2026-11-14T14:56:13.421Z",codex-toolchain-1114a,"Failure | Cause (host contract) | Fix\n--- | --- | ---\nraw exports remain documents; universal controls select structured rows | GH-1678: actual rendered Mermaid output measures 7736 tokens against the unchanged 4000-token TOON default. | Assert output_budget_exceeded/requested_budget_infeasible exit 2 for the full raw fixture. Keep a bounded root/depth raw success and unbounded structured export of every row; retain file/control refusals and no-write fingerprints.\n\nContract reference: [pm-cli 2026.11.8 migration entries](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#2026118---2026-11-08). Full gate results and timing limits are recorded in the preceding validation receipts. No workload or coverage threshold was lowered. This final comment makes the failure/cause/fix mapping explicit; source files are unchanged."
